{"kind":"inner","text":"I feel rather pleased that my first question punctured the headline. I don't much like that about myself. He did cross it out, and he hasn't tried to make the whole delay disappear with one clever fix. I'm less irritated now, though part of me still wants him to earn back time he doesn't know he's used up.","actual_native_return":"I feel rather pleased that my first question punctured the headline. I don't much like that about myself. He did cross it out, and he hasn't tried to make the whole delay disappear with one clever fix. I'm less irritated now, though part of me still wants him to earn back time he doesn't know he's used up."}